0:{"buildId":"HaSH0nfWkwbFYqcaqq3RQ","rsc":["$","$1","c",{"children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"x:mx-auto x:flex x:max-w-(--nextra-content-width)","children":["$","$L2",null,{"value":[{"value":"Method","id":"method","depth":2},{"value":"Parameters","id":"parameters","depth":2},{"value":"Returns","id":"returns","depth":2},{"value":"Related Methods","id":"related-methods","depth":2}],"children":[["$","$L3",null,{}],["$","$L4",null,{"metadata":{"title":"openModal","filePath":"content/hooks/useWalletConnect/openModal.mdx","timestamp":1770719093000},"sourceCode":"# openModal\n\nOpens the wallet connection modal. This modal allows users to select and connect to a wallet.\n\n<DocPageWithTabs\n  previewContent={\n    <OpenModalPreview />\n  }\n  codeContent={`  import { useWalletConnect } from \"__PACKAGE_NAME__\";\n\n  function ConnectButton() {\n    const { openModal, isConnected, disconnect } = useWalletConnect();\n\n    return (\n      <button onClick={() => (isConnected ? disconnect() : openModal())}>\n        {isConnected ? \"Disconnect\" : \"Connect Wallet\"}\n      </button>\n    );\n  }`}\n>\n\n## Method\n\n`openModal()`\n\n## Parameters\n\nNone\n\n## Returns\n\n`void` - No return value\n\n## Related Methods\n\n- `closeModal()` - Closes the modal\n- `isOpenModal` - Boolean state indicating if modal is open\n- `disconnect()` - Disconnects the wallet\n\n</DocPageWithTabs>","children":[["$","div",null,{"id":"nextra-skip-nav"}],["$","main",null,{"data-pagefind-body":true,"children":[["$","h1",null,{"className":"x:tracking-tight x:text-slate-900 x:dark:text-slate-100 x:font-bold x:mt-2 x:text-4xl","children":["openModal","$undefined"]}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"className":"x:not-first:mt-[1.25em] x:leading-7","children":"Opens the wallet connection modal. This modal allows users to select and connect to a wallet."}],"\n",["$","$L5",null,{"previewContent":["$","$L6",null,{}],"codeContent":"  import { useWalletConnect } from \"__PACKAGE_NAME__\";\n\nfunction ConnectButton() {\n  const { openModal, isConnected, disconnect } = useWalletConnect();\n\n  return (\n    <button onClick={() => (isConnected ? disconnect() : openModal())}>\n      {isConnected ? \"Disconnect\" : \"Connect Wallet\"}\n    </button>\n  );\n}","children":[["$","h2",null,{"id":"method","className":"x:tracking-tight x:text-slate-900 x:dark:text-slate-100 x:font-semibold x:target:animate-[fade-in_1.5s] x:mt-10 x:border-b x:pb-1 x:text-3xl nextra-border","children":["Method",["$","$L7",null,{"id":"method"}]]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"x:not-first:mt-[1.25em] x:leading-7","children":["$","$L8",null,{"children":"openModal()"}]}],["$","h2",null,{"id":"parameters","className":"x:tracking-tight x:text-slate-900 x:dark:text-slate-100 x:font-semibold x:target:animate-[fade-in_1.5s] x:mt-10 x:border-b x:pb-1 x:text-3xl nextra-border","children":["Parameters",["$","$L7",null,{"id":"parameters"}]]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"x:not-first:mt-[1.25em] x:leading-7","children":"None"}],["$","h2",null,{"id":"returns","className":"x:tracking-tight x:text-slate-900 x:dark:text-slate-100 x:font-semibold x:target:animate-[fade-in_1.5s] x:mt-10 x:border-b x:pb-1 x:text-3xl nextra-border","children":["Returns",["$","$L7",null,{"id":"returns"}]]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"x:not-first:mt-[1.25em] x:leading-7","children":[["$","$L8",null,{"children":"void"}]," - No return value"]}],["$","h2",null,{"id":"related-methods","className":"x:tracking-tight x:text-slate-900 x:dark:text-slate-100 x:font-semibold x:target:animate-[fade-in_1.5s] x:mt-10 x:border-b x:pb-1 x:text-3xl nextra-border","children":["Related Methods",["$","$L7",null,{"id":"related-methods"}]]}],["$","ul",null,{"className":"x:[:is(ol,ul)_&]:my-[.75em] x:not-first:mt-[1.25em] x:list-disc x:ms-[1.5em]","children":["\n",["$","li",null,{"className":"x:my-[.5em]","children":[["$","$L8",null,{"children":"closeModal()"}]," - Closes the modal"]}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"className":"x:my-[.5em]","children":[["$","$L8",null,{"childr